{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51527","headline":"九华山协济祠 · 罗邺","name":"九华山协济祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵庙门依山半开，松庭潇洒绝尘埃。\n时闻樵者经过说，数有神仙变化来。\n龙起阴云生画壁，鸟归寒粟落苍苔。\n自从鼓吹喧阗日，千里封疆不复灾。\n（《嘉靖池州府志》五。\n又《图书集成·职方典》八一○《池州府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}